# standard.http.semsig — generated signature sidecar (README ss26, ss34.3).
# The §34 minimal-core direction models the web server as an `HttpServer` record
# plus `http.route`/`http.serve`/`http.callNext` stdlib calls checked by this
# signature file, rather than as `webServer` keywords. Runtime (sockets, the
# middleware dispatch loop) is external surface (ss27) and not in the compiler.
# (todos WS3-017 contract surface; X-010 migration target)

httpSig is semsig
httpSig version "1.0"
httpSig generatedBy "eavc 0.1"
httpSig describes standard.http

HttpSafeUrl is alias
HttpSafeUrl for String
HttpSafeUrl purpose "A URL validated safe for URL-bearing attributes (href/src/action)"

HttpRequest is record
HttpRequest field method String
HttpRequest field path String
HttpRequest field body String
HttpRequest purpose "An inbound HTTP request passed to a handler"

HttpResponse is record
HttpResponse field status Int32
HttpResponse field body String
HttpResponse purpose "A handler's HTTP response"

HttpServer is record
HttpServer field host String
HttpServer field port Int32
HttpServer purpose "Server configuration (replaces the §14 webServer keyword surface)"

HttpError is error
HttpError purpose "Represent routing, serving, and middleware failures"

NextMiddleware is alias
NextMiddleware for OpaquePointer
NextMiddleware purpose "Continuation handle for the downstream middleware chain"

route is intrinsic
route target http.route
route arg server HttpServer
route arg method String
route arg path String
route arg handler OpaquePointer
route out registered Bool
route purpose "Register a handler for a method+path on a server"

serve is intrinsic
serve target http.serve
serve arg server HttpServer
serve out exit ExitCode
serve catch HttpError
serve async yes
serve purpose "Run the server's request loop until shutdown"

callNext is intrinsic
callNext target http.callNext
callNext arg next NextMiddleware
callNext out continued Bool
callNext purpose "Invoke the downstream middleware chain and return whether it continued"
